---
source: src/ui/tests.rs
expression: "seen.join(\"\\n\")"
---
Cargo.lock: new file | generated file, collapsed; enter expands
after.txt: renamed from before.txt
bin.dat: new file | binary file; not shown
gone.txt: deleted file; showing what was removed
link: new file | symlink; showing its target
run.sh: mode changed: file → executable
